{
  "category": "Aura Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "It has the ability to sense the auras of all things. It understands human speech.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "By catching the aura emanating from others, it can read their thoughts and movements.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "A well-trained one can sense auras to identify and take in the feelings of creatures over half a mile away.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
      "text": "It’s said that no foe can remain invisible to LUCARIO, since it can detect auras. Even foes it could not otherwise see.",
      "version": "heartgold"
    },
    {
      "text": "It’s said that no foe can remain invisible to LUCARIO, since it can detect auras. Even foes it could not otherwise see.",
      "version": "soulsilver"
    },
    {
      "text": "A well-trained one can sense auras to identify and take in the feelings of creatures over half a mile away.",
      "version": "black"
    },
    {
      "text": "A well-trained one can sense auras to identify and take in the feelings of creatures over half a mile away.",
      "version": "white"
    },
    {
      "text": "By reading the auras of all things, it can tell how others are feeling from over half a mile away.",
      "version": "black-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "By reading the auras of all things, it can tell how others are feeling from over half a mile away.",
      "version": "white-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "By catching the aura emanating from others, it can read their thoughts and movements.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "By reading the auras of all things, it can tell how others are feeling from over half a mile away.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "By catching the aura emanating from others, it can read their thoughts and movements.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "By reading the auras of all things, it can tell how others are feeling from over half a mile away.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Not only does it perceive auras, but it has also gained the power to control them. It employs them in battle.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "They can detect the species of a living being— and its emotions—from over half a mile away. They control auras and hunt their prey in packs.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "It concentrates its mental energy and fires off mysterious waves called auras, which can crush boulders of large size to dust.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lucario reads its opponent’s feelings with its aura waves. It finds out things it would rather not know, so it gets stressed out easily.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "It controls waves known as auras, which are powerful enough to pulverize huge rocks. It uses these waves to take down its prey.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "It can tell what people are thinking. Only Trainers who have justice in their hearts can earn this Pokémon’s trust.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "A most gallant-looking creature. It emits energy waves and controls them with precision, using them to sense even faraway beings. I have given the name ”aura” to this power.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
  ],
